      "summary_section": "issue",
      "labels": [
        "ISSUE"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:issue"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Whether the Petitioner proves that, the accident occurred on 18.09.2022 at 6.30 to 7.00pm, due to rash and negligent riding by the rider of Motorcycle bearing Reg.No.KA-41-EU- 6099 and in the said accident petitioner sustained injuries?"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1ca3645cf0744423881504dcd1ee4257_36",
      "summary_section": "issue",
      "labels": [
        "ISSUE"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:issue"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n2. Whether the Petitioner is entitled for Compensation?"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "39cf0bb8511246ce8c5eba47b6e0ab7d_37",
      "summary_section": "issue",
      "labels": [
        "ISSUE"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:issue"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "If so, what is the quantum?"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "03cead3e91ee441fb3856c32f3e95e45_38",
      "summary_section": "issue",
      "labels": [
        "ISSUE"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:issue"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "From whom payable?"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c6ba09b0c7774f2c8f5a7d282c471721_39",
      "summary_section": "issue",
      "labels": [
        "ISSUE"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:issue"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n3. What order or award?"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4ebfd794bf59475e84e40742679b65b7_44",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It has also got examined its official/Asst. Manager Mr.Pradeep K.S. as RW.2 and got marked Exs.R.1 & 2.\n8."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5c98ba0853854d509783c2ddf8b70019_47",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "On hearing both sides and perusal of the evidence on record this court answers the above issues as follows:-\n Issue No.1: In the affirmative,\n Issue No.2: In the affirmative,\n Issue No.3: As per the final order,\n for the following:-\n REASON"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d4c9d48e4d334243bd0d54a3f9777a3b_48",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In order to prove that the accident occurred due to the actionable negligence on the part of the rider of the motorcycle bearing Reg.No.KA-41-EU-6099 the petitioner has examined himself as PW.1 and has got marked 8 documents as per Exs.P.1 "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8da0f06bf60e43af9847bdbf682915a8_49",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "PW.1 has reiterated the averments of the petition in his affidavit in lieu of his chief examination."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "af417ab3152c4c05afa04abb4f5356d0_50",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The Respondent No.2 has denied the involvement of the offending motorcycle in the accident."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8fffd4ec42424358a44cd0f2692c384f_51",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Further contended that the accident occurred due to the sole negligence of the petitioner himself and he sustained grievous injuries by not wearing helmet."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3b358e657d46419fbb1bd0b8219c3d82_52",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In the cross- examination of PW.1, he has stated that he did not have DL.\n11."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f321c42066dd4e12a99ac12456949840_53",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In support of the defence the respondent No.2 has got examined Dr.Nagaraja Upadhya - Medical Officer as RW.1."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b20b27b83a9d43f8aa49896ac2a9339d_54",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "He has deposed in his chief examination that, there is no MLC register extract and police intimation was sent in the name of the petitioner."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3feafbee6c0f46cd9d95383623e4357f_55",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "He has given preliminary first aid treatment to the petitioner."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6ff4313a00ee4197a4530e3922655157_56",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "They did not register the MLC in this case since the petitioner took only first aid."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "effb7da45a8f4c46a3491ffa8d1f75a9_57",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The petitioner gave the history as fall from bike."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3691fe6cc8004ad59336c23b0d10fe68_58",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "They have given OPD slip for first aid treatment."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "28fdf11978e8457bbdab41d80a3abe86_59",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "During the cross examination of RW.1, he has stated that on 18.09.2022 the petitioner has taken first aid treatment in their hospital."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2654ba92aae64054ae0ccb0fb92b0ffd_60",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "12. The documents at Exs.P.1 to P.8 i.e., FIR with Complaint, PF, spot mahazar, notice u/Sec.133 of IMV Act, reply to the notice u/Sec.133 of MV Act, IMV report, wound certificate and charge sheet are in accordance with the statement given "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b07c5a8a96244cb3a9bf8d9185d2b632_61",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "No contrary evidence is led against these documents from the side of respondent No.2.\n13."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "01239dfd1ef94beca7bda42bb799882d_62",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As per Ex.P.7/Wound Certificate, the petitioner sustained injuries on 18.09.2022 in an RTA."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d9e17c5ea42b4c1d9978de85a1c4f03d_63",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "This shows that on account of the accident the Petitioner has sustained simple and grievous injuries."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "45c073a5b47c496cb341e3c7b358abeb_64",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nTherefore, on overall perusal of Exs.P.1 to 8 it is clear that the accident occurred on 18.09.2022 and the petitioner sustained injuries as mentioned in Ex.P.7."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "7d284da5e60d4c6b9ad2ba78df0c2e22_65",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The point of dispute between the parties is Nagesh D.M vs Premasagar M.K on 10 December, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/96429739/\n4 the status of the petitioner in the bike i.e., whether he was the rider or the pillion rid"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "dfe1d14d731d4de99ba3342046132479_66",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In order to buttress their contention the respondent No.2 has relied on the oral evidence of RW.1/Medical Officer of Mytri Hospital."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "46f35fefda7140458bb29e51db22536d_67",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "But no supporting document is produced."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0f8994c418284c528a4b108270422004_68",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, this contention cannot be accepted."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "da7d6df9cd6849b1a5d0e8fe7d8b287f_69",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The respondent No.2 has also contended that there is 12 days delay in registering the FIR and the petitioner has cooked up a story showing him as the pillion rider."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "7fc897e45a2342c3890fa7a89efde0df_70",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "But it is to be noted here that the petitioner got admitted to Mythri Hospital as per RW.1 for first aid treatment on 18.09.2022 and later went to Vijayanagara Hospital on 21.09.2022 and the FIR was registered on 30.09.2022."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3be359dd21bc4224a806992cd3eedb19_71",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Such being the case, it is clear that the accident in fact occurred and the petitioner sustained injuries in the accident."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8d47fc9c9d694e609acd5e70dfd5db9b_72",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Only the fact of delay in registering the FIR cannot be held against the petitioner."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5bf18d8f9a3e447282528c93fbc34d42_73",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As such, on perusal of the above said documents this Tribunal holds that there was negligence on the part of the rider of the offending motorcycle."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4660aef79d334780b4e66a39738329b9_74",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Accordingly, issue No.1 is held in the affirmative."
